# =====================================================================
# CONFIDENTIAL - never commit. The challenge rules forbid publishing or
# redistributing recordings (children are identifiable). Anything DERIVED
# from a recording (audio, frames, transcripts, per-job outputs) is covered too.
# =====================================================================

